    "title": "Yankees Struggle with Bullpen Issues Amidst Season Slump",
    "text": "Trending Story\nUpdated 04:00 AM UTC, Thu July 3, 2025\nYankees Struggle with Bullpen Issues Amidst Season Slump\nAfter the Yankees’ 12-5 road loss to the Blue Jays on Tuesday, Brandon London breaks down the struggles of the slumping Bombers, who hold a one game lead in the AL East with Toronto and Tampa Bay hot on their heels. For top headlines, breaking news and more, visit nypost.com.\nAaron Boone\n\"“It’s on me, I got to do a better job of getting those guys in positions where they can be successful, making the right decisions for them to make sure they’re in the best spot possible. But obviously been a little bit of a tough stretch for us.”\"\nFireside Yankees\n\"“The Yanks must work their way out and give the Twins something that they cannot refuse.”\"\nComments\nCaroll Winchester\nthey lost a few games,it's the end of the world!\n1",
